  "description": "OEDRO Custom Fit Cargo Liner for 2015-2025 Ford Edge – Premium TPE All-Weather Protection. Keep your Ford Edge’s cargo area in pristine condition with the OEDRO Custom Fit Cargo Liner, designed specifically for 2015-2025 Ford Edge models. Utilizing precision digital laser scanning technology, this cargo liner offers an exact fit, ensuring complete coverage and protection for your vehicle’s foot space and cargo area.\nFeatures\nPerfect Custom Fit: Engineered with advanced laser scanning technology to match the exact contours of your 2015-2025 Ford Edge, providing seamless coverage and protection.\nSuperior Heat Resistance: With 300% higher heat resistance than traditional PVC materials, this cargo liner can withstand extreme temperatures without warping or cracking.\nHigh-Strength TPE Material: Made from durable, eco-friendly TPE (Thermoplastic Elastomer), this liner is not only extremely wear-resistant but also maintains flexibility in freezing temperatures, ensuring year-round performance.\nAll-Weather Protection: Effectively shields your cargo area from spills, dirt, scratches, and debris, keeping your Ford Edge’s interior looking like new.\nEasy to Clean: The smooth, non-porous surface allows for quick and hassle-free cleaning – simply wipe or rinse to remove any mess.\nEco-Friendly & Odorless: Crafted from non-toxic, environmentally safe materials that are safe for you, your passengers, and the planet.\n2 years warranty. For your safety, professional installation recommended.\nFitment\nCompatible for 2015-2025 Ford Edge.",
